---
description: Tiny Factory Rush XR project operating rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read AGENTS.md before modifying the project.

For XR work, also read:
- docs/xr/PRODUCT_THESIS.md
- docs/xr/ROADMAP.md
- docs/xr/DECISIONS.md

Rules:
- game first, industrial engineering invisible;
- tabletop MR, hands-first;
- visible consequences over numerical dashboards;
- one polished mechanic over broad scope;
- do not add workers, detailed safety, detailed quality, detailed maintenance, multiplayer, AI assistant, or complex supply-chain features without an accepted experiment/decision;
- preserve the pre-competition Git history;
- never claim a test passed unless it was actually run;
- update docs only when evidence or project state changed.
